  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_031) achieve the highest accuracy (0.6776). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a more powerful image encoder) and switching fusion from weighted to concat, while keeping RNA encoder and aggregation consistent. This clarifies whether the image encoder choice or fusion method is the critical factor for performance, balancing exploitation of the current best setup with exploration of key design decisions."
